# The video relay (Cloudflare Worker in shim/). Bake it into the build; users never see it.
# A subdomain of your own beats *.workers.dev, which some DNS resolvers and extensions block
# (shim/README.md). The official build uses https://relay.hypeline.live.
VITE_SHIM_URL=https://relay.example.com

# Twitch sign-in for the dashboard home (who you follow, live now, latest VODs — ADR-19).
# Register the app at https://dev.twitch.tv/console/apps (category "Website Integration",
# client type "Public", OAuth Redirect URLs: http://localhost:5173/dashboard and the deployed
# host's /dashboard — for the official build, https://hypeline.live/dashboard).
# Paste the Client ID here; there is no secret.
VITE_TWITCH_CLIENT_ID=

# Where "Suggest a feature / Report a bug / Ask a question" send people (the ? in the rail).
# owner/repo on GitHub; the issue templates in .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/ match the links.
# Defaults to the project's own repo, so a fork only needs this when it wants its own issues.
VITE_GITHUB_REPO=Angel-Casas/Hypeline
